    subtopic: 'Arms Of Government',
    summary_60s: 'Lesson Objective By the end of the lesson, students should be able to: Identify the three arms of government. Explain the functions of each arm. Relate each arm of government to its role in Nigeria. Nigeria\'s government is divided into three main arms : The Executive The Legislat',
