    summary_60s: 'Pre-Colonial Systems of Government in Nigeria Study of Hausa/Fulani, Yoruba and Igbo systems of government. A. The System of Government in Precolonial Hausa/Fulani Societies 1. General Features Precolonial Hausa/Fulani societies in West Africa developed a structured political sys',
