    summary_60s: 'Nigeria\'s path to self-governance is marked by two key constitutional milestones: the 1960 Independence Constitution and the 1963 Republican Constitution. The Independence Constitution, enacted on October 1, 1960, marked Nigeria\'s sovereignty while maintaining the British Queen a',
